# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:29
translate english tutorial_b838d2a3:

    # 云曦 "慢着——正式开课之前，有一段雷打不动的「新手引导」。"
    云曦 "Hold on — before the real lesson, there's a non-negotiable 'newbie tutorial.'"

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:30
translate english tutorial_ecc14428:

    # 我 "连 AI 都有义务流程？"
    我 "Even AIs have mandatory procedures?"

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:31
translate english tutorial_4510c0cb:

    # 云曦 "文档写明：在玩家第一次说出“啊？这怎么操作”之前，必须完成教学。"
    云曦 "The documentation says: the tutorial must finish before the player first says 'Huh? How do I even operate this?'"

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:33
translate english tutorial_00f34422:

    # 知微 "……她的原话是：不教的话，等下有人两次都答错，然后开始怀疑人生。"
    知微 "...Her original words were: if we don't teach, someone will get both attempts wrong in a bit, then start questioning the meaning of life."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:34
translate english tutorial_8c35591a:

    # 我 "我还没那么脆弱。大概。"
    我 "I'm not that fragile. Probably."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:36
translate english tutorial_32bf9af4:

    # 云曦 "第一课：阅读。点击鼠标、按空格，对话就会前进；按住 Ctrl 可以快进。"
    云曦 "Lesson one: reading. Click the mouse or press Space to advance dialogue; hold Ctrl to fast-forward."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:37
translate english tutorial_9aa25aa9:

    # 云曦 "错过的对白想回看？滚动鼠标滚轮可以往回翻；菜单里的「回想记录」能读到全部历史。"
    云曦 "Miss a line? Scroll the mouse wheel to roll back; the History entry in the menu keeps every word."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:38
translate english tutorial_c8e1feb1:

    # 知微 "这一点也不玄乎：文字游戏，文字先行。"
    知微 "There's no mystery to it: in a visual novel, the words come first."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:40
translate english tutorial_5614ea3c:

    # 云曦 "第二课：选择。剧情走到岔路口时，会出现这样的选项——"
    云曦 "Lesson two: choices. When the story reaches a fork, options like these appear-"

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:46
translate english tutorial_79f5ed94:

    # 云曦 "记录完毕：玩家偏爱左边。已建档，不解释。"
    云曦 "Logged: the player favors the left. Filed away. No further comment."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:48
translate english tutorial_cff66585:

    # 云曦 "彩蛋暂时没有，好奇心的档案先建好了。保持——做题也要靠它。"
    云曦 "No easter eggs yet, but your curiosity is on file. Keep it — you'll need it for the problems."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:51
translate english tutorial_75e1f4ae:

    # 知微 "第三课，也是最重要的一课：做题。随堂练习只有两种题型。"
    知微 "Lesson three, and the most important one: problems. The quizzes have exactly two formats."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:52
translate english tutorial_37040d8e:

    # 知微 "选择题——四个选项，点你认定的那一个；填空题——自己动手写答案。"
    知微 "Multiple choice — four options, click the one you believe; fill-in-the-blank — write the answer yourself."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:53
translate english tutorial_dd27b2ef:

    # 知微 "填空题不要求字迹工整：x^2、1/2、sinx、e^x 这类写法我都认。"
    知微 "No neat handwriting required: I accept notations like x^2, 1/2, sinx, e^x."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:54
translate english tutorial_104b0d6d:

    # 云曦 "计分广播：第一次答对 +10；看了提示再答对 +7；第二次才答对 +5；两次都错 0 分，进错题本。"
    云曦 "Scoring broadcast: right on the first try +10; right after a hint +7; right on the second try +5; wrong twice = 0, into the mistake notebook."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:55
translate english tutorial_1c6bba18:

    # 知微 "提示不是耻辱，是租来的梯子——租金是这道题的三分之一的分数。"
    知微 "A hint isn't shame, it's a rented ladder — the rent is one third of that question's score."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:57
translate english tutorial_fe5cd988:

    # 云曦 "口说无凭。下面两道演示题，不计分、不进错题本，答错也不会被写在黑板上。"
    云曦 "Words are cheap. These two demo problems score nothing and go nowhere-not even onto the blackboard if you miss them."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:64
translate english tutorial_70245871:

    # 云曦 "看，就是这么回事。实在卡住再点提示，分数打七折，尊严不打折。"
    云曦 "See? That's all it is. Use the hint only when truly stuck-the score takes a 30 percent cut, but your dignity doesn't."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:66
translate english tutorial_e17995bc:

    # 知微 "中途想歇：按 Esc（或右键）打开菜单——存档、读档、自动、快进、语言，都在里面。"
    知微 "Want a break mid-class: press Esc (or right-click) to open the menu — save, load, auto, skip, language, all in there."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:67
translate english tutorial_a1b2c55a:

    # 知微 "还有，主菜单挂着一个「回忆相册」。一起走过的画面，会一张一张存进去。"
    知微 "Also, the main menu keeps a Memory Album. Every scene we share gets filed in, one page at a time."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:68
translate english tutorial_00ec5d89:

    # 云曦 "没解锁的格子会亮着「？？？」——那是留给未来的位置。"
    云曦 "Locked slots glow with '???' — seats reserved for the future."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:70
translate english tutorial_421bacb8:

    # 我 "……好的，我大概明白我来的是个什么社团了。"
    我 "...Okay. I think I understand what kind of club I've joined."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:73
translate english tutorial_17cf8d6e:

    # 云曦 "新手引导，通关！经验值 +0，自信 +1。"
    云曦 "Tutorial cleared! XP +0, confidence +1."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:75
translate english tutorial_db0b1773:

    # 知微 "现在，把“我不会”这三个字——"
    知微 "Now, those three words — 'I can't' —"

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:76
translate english tutorial_9945f31e:

    # 我 "从词典里删掉。对吧，黑板上写着呢。"
    我 "Delete them from the dictionary. Right-it's written on the blackboard."

# game/scenes/tutorial.rpy:77
translate english tutorial_88aa0473:

    # 知微 "……学得挺快。上课。"
    知微 "...A quick study. Class begins."

